# The party wiped out on the map (build 157c). A level-1 Rolf on Gaira's
# damage floor: a point of HP each step off cells 3,6 and 3,7 (loc_7108),
# eighteen steps up and down, then "ROLF is dead!" (ObjType_Events $30,
# $1721). Once it has played out, loc_E01A sets ScreenID_Sega, and the
# level loop's loc_7DEC -- the controls unlocked -- branches to
# GameOverScreen: the game over music, tiles 0-$5BF erased over 32
# frames (loc_6C54) under the level and the window as they stood
# (VBlank $24 sends no party art), PaletteFadeFrom, then the message on
# the title picture, and SegaScreen after it. Until 157c the port went
# from the window straight to the SEGA screen: no game over.
#
# (build 182) Rolf is not there for any of it. RenderCharSprites runs
# every pass of the level loop, and its per-slot step (loc_11868) hides a
# slot whose member is at 0 HP; the loop's next RunObjects leaves the
# hidden object out of the sprite table. So the frame after the floor
# takes his last point he is gone, before "ROLF is dead!". Build 157c
# pinned him at 54,89 through the erase: the port drew every member then,
# whatever the HP. With nobody standing in a wipe-out, no party sprite is
# left for VBlank $24's missing art to show.

start level $41 3 5
party 1 1
wait idle
walk down 2                  # onto 3,7: 18 HP
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
expect script $1721          # "ROLF is dead!"
shot 01_dead
expect pixel 54 89 $886      # the floor where he stood: hidden at 0 HP
press c
wait ticks 16
expect screen gameover
expect music $95             # MusicID_Over
shot 02_erasing
expect pixel 54 89 $886      # the floor, half the places still in
expect pixel 100 177 $800     # the window's fill: it stays, its tiles going
wait ticks 14
shot 03_erased
expect pixel 54 89 $000      # gone with the rest, not sent again
wait script $1218            # "ROLF and the others failed ..."
wait ticks 300               # typed
shot 04_message
expect pixel 80 89 $EEE
press c
wait screen sega
